---
import PublicPage from "./PublicPage.astro";
---

<PublicPage
  title="成为照护者 | PetCare 宠伴"
  description="了解成为 PetCare 照护者需要准备什么、如何参与以及需要承担的照护责任。"
>
  <main id="main-content" class="info-page info-page--caregivers">
    <section class="info-page__hero" aria-labelledby="caregivers-page-title">
      <div class="content-container info-page__hero-grid">
        <div class="info-page__hero-copy" data-scroll-reveal>
          <p class="eyebrow">成为照护者</p>
          <h1 id="caregivers-page-title">喜欢宠物，也愿意认真照顾它们。</h1>
          <p>照护不是一句“喜欢就好”。先了解参与条件、可做的范围，以及一次服务需要承担的责任。</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/help#contact"
            >查看参与帮助 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
          >
        </div>
        <figure class="info-page__hero-image" data-scroll-reveal>
          <img
            src="/brand/pet-life-grooming.jpg"
            width="960"
            height="720"
            alt="照护者在家中整理宠物毛发"
            fetchpriority="high"
          />
          <figcaption>画面为生活场景示意，不代表具体服务案例。</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="info-page__section" aria-labelledby="caregivers-fit-title">
      <div class="content-container info-page__section-grid">
        <header class="info-page__section-heading" data-scroll-reveal>
          <p class="eyebrow">参与前先确认</p>
          <h2 id="caregivers-fit-title">适合怎样的人参与？</h2>
        </header>
        <div class="info-page__reading" data-scroll-reveal>
          <ul class="info-page__line-list">
            <li>
              <strong>愿意按约定沟通</strong><span>及时确认时间、范围和宠物需要留意的事项。</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>能够稳定完成照护</strong><span>只承接自己能按时、按范围完成的内容。</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>愿意留下过程记录</strong><span>按实际情况说明进展、异常和完成结果。</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="info-page__note">
            资格、服务范围和申请状态以平台当前配置与审核结果为准；页面不承诺收入或接单数量。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section
      class="info-page__section info-page__section--soft"
      aria-labelledby="caregivers-steps-title"
    >
      <div class="content-container">
        <header
          class="info-page__section-heading info-page__section-heading--wide"
          data-scroll-reveal
        >
          <p class="eyebrow">参与之后</p>
          <h2 id="caregivers-steps-title">从确认资格，到完成一次有记录的照护。</h2>
        </header>
        <ol class="info-page__flow info-page__flow--three" aria-label="照护者参与过程">
          <li data-scroll-reveal>
            <span>01</span><h3>了解范围</h3><p>确认可参与的服务类型、时间和责任边界。</p>
          </li>
          <li data-scroll-reveal>
            <span>02</span><h3>确认订单</h3><p>查看宠物资料和需求，和主人确认执行方式。</p>
          </li>
          <li data-scroll-reveal>
            <span>03</span><h3>完成交付</h3><p>按约定执行、记录过程，并提交完成反馈。</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="info-page__closing" aria-labelledby="caregivers-closing-title">
      <div class="content-container info-page__closing-inner" data-scroll-reveal>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">需要更多说明？</p>
          <h2 id="caregivers-closing-title">先到帮助中心确认当前入口。</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="button" href="/help#contact">打开帮助中心 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</PublicPage>
